OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GWe're handing over the trunk to
OL,7,     GIrvine Welsh. Irvine has turned
OL,8,     Ghis attention to the sound of
OL,9,     Gsoul, groove and dance-floor
OL,10,     Gstories.
OL,11,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,12,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,13,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,14,     Gweek, he's got culture clash cuts
OL,15,     Gfrom the likes of Om Unit, Aphex
OL,16,     GTwin, Funkadelic, OneDa and Elton
OL,17,     GJohn.
OL,18,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,19,     GSHERELLE plays some of her
OL,20,     Gfavourite techno, both new and
